 System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev (3f0b3afe3) - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8088) - AMD Ryzen 9 7950X 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 31.15 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe `Copy Node Path` in the Remote scene tree doesn't return the actual runtime path. It returns the path relative to the scene, like in the Local scene tree.\n\nIf I have a main scene `combat.tscn` with a node tree:\n\n```\nCombat\n├── Debug\n│   └── VBoxContainer\n```\n\n`Copy Node Path` in the Local scene tree will return `Debug/VBoxContainer`.\n\nWhen the game is running, the Remove scene tree is:\n\n```\nroot\n├── Combat\n│      ├── Debug\n│      │   └── VBoxContainer\n```\n\n`Copy Node Path` in the Remove scene tree will also return `Debug/VBoxContainer` too. It should return `Combat/Debug/VBoxContainer`, which is the correct path to pass to `get_tree().root.get_node(node_path)`.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRight-click node > `Copy Node Path` in both the Local and Remote scene tree.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/receiv